diagnosis-TAUSSIG-DIAG-0056\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0056</a></td><td>Communication interventriculaire</td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISBROADERTHANTARGET\">&gt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG168\">DIAG168</a><i>(sous-type ou association)</i><br/><span title=\"SOURCEISBROADERTHANTARGET\">&gt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG169\">DIAG169</a><i>(sous-type ou association)</i><br/><span title=\"SOURCEISBROADERTHANTARGET\">&gt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG008\">DIAG008</a><i>(sous-type ou association)</i><br/><span title=\"SOURCEISBROADERTHANTARGET\">&gt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG170\">DIAG170</a><i>(sous-type ou association)</i><br/><span title=\"SOURCEISBROADERTHANTARGET\">&gt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG172\">DIAG172</a><i>(sous-type ou association)</i><br/><span title=\"SOURCEISBROADERTHANTARGET\">&gt;</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG174\">DIAG174</a><i>(sous-type ou association)</i></td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html#ipccc-07.4610.4600\">07.10.00</a><i>(libellé TAUSSIG = traduction du terme IPCCC)</i></td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span>LA88.4<i>(terme IPCCC repris par la CIM-11 (hiérarchie diagnostique IPCCC–CIM-11))</i></td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span>Q21.0</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-taussig-diagnosis.html#taussig-diagnosis-TAUSSIG-DIAG-0057\">TAUSSIG-DIAG-0057</a></td><td>Communication interventriculaire musculaire trabéculaire</td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-echsa.html#echsa-DIAG173\">DIAG173</a></td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span><a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html#ipccc-07.4611.4601\">07.11.01</a><i>(libellé TAUSSIG = traduction du terme IPCCC)</i></td><td><span title=\"EQUIVALENT\">~</span>LA88.40<i>(terme IPCCC repris par la CIM-11 (hiérarchie diagnostique IPCCC–CIM-11))</i></td><td><span title=\"SOURCEISNARROWERTHANTARGET\">&lt;</span>Q21.0<i>(sous-type d